WEBVTT

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:16.530
Th-That's...

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:19.370
That machine...

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.160
A crimson mobile suit.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.580
That's the legendary...

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:26.460
Gunpla.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.300
Perfect Gundam III...

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.050
Red Warrior!

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:25.120
Master Kawaguchi the Third.

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:27.210
The inheritor of the Kawaguchi name,

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.250
which is revered among Gunpla fans.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:33.670
The man who holds the title of Master.

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:38.010
He won the Gunpla Battle World Championship three times in a row,

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:39.260
and entered the Hall of Fame.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:43.010
Right. He's truly the King of Gunpla.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:47.520
His latest machine is the legendary...

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:51.350
Yes. Its name is...

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:53.650
Amazing Red Warrior!

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:59.400
Why is Master Kawaguchi here?

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.910
Master... Kawaguchi.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.000
What a pleasure.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:13.170
I didn't expect the great Master to come and fight with me.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:16.920
I've been pretty bored lately.

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:20.880
The only one who can fight me equally is Kijima.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.590
The rest aren't even in the same league.

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:29.560
I plan to enter the open tournament in this year's championship.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:34.150
If I win the nationals, then I can battle the world's top fighters.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:39.320
Ricardo Fellini. Luang Dallara. Greco Logan.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:43.070
<i>And Master Kawaguchi, you're one of them.</i>

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:44.200
What nonsense.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:48.490
Going to the World Championships,                     with your current ability?

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:50.750
You're sayng it's impossible?

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.670
Then, let me try...

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:55.590
in this battle!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.050
With pinpoint precision...

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:01.920
The beams...

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.630
He shot them down!

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.550
Good, good!

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.560
Then, how's this!?

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:19.320
W-With one stroke!?

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:20.400
There's more!

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.670
Wow, you're really something.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.500
So this is the Master's power?

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.340
Then, I'll use my ultimate technique!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.020
Oh?

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:57.480
Take this! Dead End--

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.020
<i>Battle aborted.</i>

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:02.900
A forced shutdown?

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:04.820
Who did this!?

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:08.120
That's enough.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:12.370
I can't let you keep fighting at damage level B.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.410
C-Coach...

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:18.040
Don't be so tough on our team members, Master.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:21.210
Then you'd better rein them in.

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:26.550
I don't like those who disrespect their opponents and fight with arrogance.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.930
I'll be sure to remind them.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:29.800
Sekai!

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:33.350
Sekai, are you all right?

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:35.560
Yuu, help us!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:38.940
Yuu?

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.570
N-No way...

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.280
My Lightning...

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:54.700
Yuu!

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.040
Fumina, let's take him to the dispensary.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:05:59.880
Y-Yes.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.840
Assimilated, was he? Lieutenant?

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:08.970
Yes. He really gets into it.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.640
Assimilated...?

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:15.350
I saw the final round of the regional qualifiers.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:18.600
Turning his pure feelings to fire...

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.360
He's truly a burning boy.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:27.280
As well as the Gunpla Academy, Master Kawaguchi also joined the battle.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:31.280
It looks like this training camp should be interesting.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.180
<i>I lost.</i>

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:55.430
<i>I lost again.</i>

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:05.780
<i>I'll build an awesome Gunpla and enter the championship with you.</i>

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:07.820
<i>I promise!</i>

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:13.700
<i>You have no talent...</i>

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.990
<i>for Gunpla Battle.</i>

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:34.890
"Keeping my promise"?

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:37.930
"Getting back what I had lost"?

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:39.640
I...

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:44.730
I've done nothing at all... Nothing.

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:50.400
Darn it!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:57.370
If Coach hadn't stopped us, my Gundam The End would've beaten the Master by now.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.950
Do you really think so?

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:00.910
What?

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:05.630
If you'd continued the battle, how would it have ended?

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:11.050
Nobody knows that better than you yourself, Adou.

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:17.430
Such is the ability of the King of Gunpla, huh?

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:21.680
I'll surpass him.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:27.230
If that guy is a huge mountain, then I'll just fly even higher.

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:30.900
I envy you.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:31.650
Huh?

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.530
Are you mocking me?

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:36.700
I'm saying that I'm lucky to have you as a teammate.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.920
It's not that bad.

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.040
He'll wake up sooner or later.

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:50.460
Yeah.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:55.760
Mr. Ral, can you look after Sekai for a while?

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:58.300
Huh? Sure, but...

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:01.640
Thank you. I have to go.

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:03.270
Where to, Fumina?

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:05.730
I need to find Yuu.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:09.860
<i>If...</i>

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:13.030
<i>If it's because of a battle with that fighter</i>

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:16.990
<i>that he quit Gunpla Battle two years ago...</i>

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.300
Master Kawaguchi.

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.800
Leaving your Gunpla behind.

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:38.220
disqualifies you as a builder.

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:43.640
The last time I met you was at the Artistic Gunpla Contest, huh?

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:44.810
Kousaka.

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.810
Thank you for taking care of me then.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.560
I'm the one being taken care of.

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.270
By your sister.

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:53.690
My sister...?

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:57.030
Get on.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.450
Why should I get on...?

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.280
No questions asked.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:09.540
That's...

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.590
Yuu and Master Kawaguchi. Where are they going?

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:17.550
<i>Leave him to the third Meijin.</i>

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:28.390
Wh-Who are you?

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:35.690
My name is Lady Kawaguchi.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:39.570
The woman who inherited the name of Kawaguchi.

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:48.710
My name is Lady Kawaguchi.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:52.170
The woman who inherited the name of Kawaguchi.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.500
Lady Kawaguchi...

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:08.730
Y-You're the woman from back then...

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:10.140
Back then?

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:14.860
Six yeas ago, weren't you in the Kanto invitational tournament?

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:17.070
You were using a Gunpla from Stargazer.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:20.200
Well, I don't remember.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:21.860
Right...

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:26.370
Oh, where's Master Kawaguchi taking Yuu?

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.370
The third Master is such a do-gooder.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:37.380
<i>If somebody's lost interest in Gunpla, that man can't ignore him.</i>

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.930
Don't worry about him.

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:45.850
You should think of yourself.

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:51.890
As a Gunpla builder and fighter,

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:54.100
you're definitely lacking something.

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:57.900
Lacking something...?

00:11:58.440 --> 00:11:59.690
Yes, that's right.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.200
What is it?

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.820
What do I lack?

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:06.780
<i>I'm bad at explaining with words.</i>

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:11.830
So I can only teach you through a battle.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.290
Do you want to try?

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:24.970
Ah, that's the Master!

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.470
It's Master Kawaguchi!

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:28.060
Wow, in the flesh.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.060
Cool.

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:30.890
Why is the Master here?

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:34.440
Manager, please let us use the battle system.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.190
S-Sure. WIth pleasure.

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.610
Umm, Master, if you wouldn't mind...

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:39.940
I'll sign autographs later.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:41.070
Wow.

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:43.320
He replies at three times normal speed, too.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.370
Master, why are we here?

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.790
To play a battle, of course.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:54.580
If you saw the battle at the Labs, you should already know.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:58.250
There'd be no contest between you and I.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.800
A sensible view.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:04.970
But it also sounds as if you're giving up before even trying.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.390
That's not what I...

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:08.680
So I'll give you a handicap.

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:16.480
You can use my Amazing Red Warrior.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:21.280
I'll fight with the Gunpla you built.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.650
With the Lightning?

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:26.820
Don't worry. I'll set the damage level to C.

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.200
What's that?

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.280
Are you playing with me?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.370
Yes, let's play.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.540
Let's do it seriously from the bottom of our hearts.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:41.750
<i>Gunpla battle, combat mode, startup.</i>

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:44.720
<i>Model damage level set to C.</i>

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.380
<i>Please set your GP Base.</i>

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:50.930
<i>Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.100
<i>Field 1, Space.</i>

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.230
<i>Please set your Gunpla.</i>

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:05.360
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:11.990
Kousaka Yuuma, Amazing Red Warrior, here I go!

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:16.370
Master Kawaguchi, Lightning Gundam, here I come!

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.840
I can barely use the left arm.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:28.300
Oh?

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:31.680
Although it's been damaged, it's still maneuvering well.

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:36.640
This machine is surely the work of an Artistic Gunpla Constest winner.

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.480
The Amazing Red Warrior.

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.400
Even looking at it objectively, it's a great machine.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.400
I don't mind praising myself.

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:51.410
There's almost no play in the arm rakers.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:53.830
What a souped-up machine.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.950
And this output and firepower.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.370
This is a Gunpla built by a Master...

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.630
fighting with a machine I built myself.

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:08.760
Gotcha!

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:14.890
One more shot.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:17.680
He dodged it?

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:20.980
That's my Lightning!?

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.900
You've built such a great machine.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:26.020
Then why, Kousaka!?

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.440
It's closing on me!?

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:35.530
They won't hit!?

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.830
Maintain distance and adjust position...

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.330
He disappeared. Where...?

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:50.880
As I thought, you're sensible.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:55.010
Understanding the machines, analyzing the opponent's strenght,

00:15:55.390 --> 00:16:00.230
and selecting the best tactic depending on the situation.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:01.730
But...

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.900
<i>you fight not to lose.</i>

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:07.110
That's negative thinking!

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:09.230
That's not true.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:14.200
I'm doing my best!

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:19.450
Your so-called best is just the limit you've place on yourself!

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:20.870
That's isn't true!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:24.460
I've tried so hard.

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:28.550
I've... I've been trying hard all the time!

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:31.590
Don't use the words "try hard" to console yourself.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:35.050
Those words are for cheering on others!

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:37.970
<i>You repeat the words,</i>

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:41.770
"I did my best" or "I tried hard" like a magic charm.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:44.600
You're spoiling yourself!

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:54.030
Dare I say it. There are no limits to Gunpla!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:15.260
It's not my Gunpla's performance,

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.260
or my talent as a fighter.

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.140
The problem lies in my heart.

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:24.100
Because my heart is weak...

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:28.690
I let the Lightning get damaged like this.

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:31.070
It's my fault.

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:35.030
Kousaka...

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.150
Thank is great.

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:41.660
I still have room for improvement.

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:46.750
I can break the limits that I created, and change myself.

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:50.250
I can become stronger!

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.840
It's a difficult path.

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:56.680
But it's one worth taking.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:00.850
Master, please give me one more battle.

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:02.890
As many times as you like.

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:05.270
But only untill the store's closing time.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:06.060
Yes!

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:26.540
If shooting doesn't work,

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.580
I'll fight her up close!

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.170
Is this all you've got?

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:33.300
Not yet!

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:47.020
No way!

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.190
As I thought, that's all you had.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.200
Go!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:13.460
You can't manage the weapons that you made yourself.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.130
What a disgraceful Gunpla.

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:20.680
With the sword of Maryu Kenshi Zero Gundam!

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:34.560
Go back to zero!

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:46.660
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:55.630
Do you understand now what you're lacking?

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:59.420
What I'm lacking...

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:02.590
If you don't understand,

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:06.100
I recommend you drop out of the national tournament.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:14.730
What am I lacking...?

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:17.610
Sekai.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:19.570
Yuu.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:21.860
I...

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.080
I understand now...!

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:37.500
Hey, Sekai. You should stay in bed.

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.340
I'm fine, Mr. Ral.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:43.550
Please tell Hoshino and Yuuma that I'm fixing my Gunpla!

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:44.800
Wait.

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:48.850
With your building skills, fixing that Gunpla is...!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.180
Oh boy.

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:53.310
So this is youth.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:56.190
I can't waste my time.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:59.610
Adou Saga was strong.

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:03.400
He was really awesome!

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:08.200
There'll be lots of strong guys like him in the national tournament.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:12.750
I'm getting excited!

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.960
I'll fix you soon, Build Burning.

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:50.740
H-Hey...

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:57.500
So beautiful.

00:21:58.290 --> 00:21:58.880
Huh?

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:02.880
Your Gunpla is so beautiful.

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:47.320
Please let me join your club.

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:50.400
I know I'm asking for too much.

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:55.280
But there's a guy that I have to fight!

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:56.830
Please!

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:02.500
A Battle Royal among representatives from each team.

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:05.250
Sekai and the Build Burning will finally awaken.

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:07.090
Next Episode, "Beyond the Knuckle."

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:09.510
Reach your fist out far!
